/* KPlayer resources - keep this file ASCII only.
   Built by build.bat:  python Tools\MakeRes.py -> KPlayerResource.res
   (windres is not used: the one shipped with Lazarus has no C preprocessor.)
   File names are lower case and use '/' on purpose: macOS is case sensitive. */
